WEBVTT

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:03.550
After my return with Astral,

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.840
I carried on Kaito's duel, and beat Heartland.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:11.330
But at that moment, trying to fuse our world and the Barian's,

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.510
that crimson pillar of light was weirdly glowing even brighter.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.020
What the heck's that!?

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:25.150
Wha- what's happening?

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:40.110
What's going on?!

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.220
Oh? That's...?!

00:00:58.920 --> 00:00:59.350
{marker}

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:03.530
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.770
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:20.460
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:24.640
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:31.460
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:35.440
the feelings I want to express.

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:44.460
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.710
Right now, with you

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:51.640
Oh - By facing each other,

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:58.720
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:03.820
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:09.250
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:14.420
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:24.000
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.460
Shark!? You...?

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:33.840
Why are you...?

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:39.130
Why are you together with these Barians?

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:46.060
<i>The Seven Barian Emperors, warriors of crimson world!</i>

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:44.220
Just, what the heck is going on?

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:45.970
Ryouga!

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:48.060
A- and Rio-<i>san</i> too!

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:52.480
Hey, Shark!

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:53.730
Shark...

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:58.240
It feels like its been ages since someone called me that.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.820
But now, I am no longer

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:02.820
"Shark" or "Ryouga".

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:04.410
I am Nasch!

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.660
Nasch of the Barians!

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.370
I beg your <i>purr</i>don?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:11.620
What does he mean?

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:19.220
Shark, just, whatвЂ™re you saying there?

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.470
You mean, you're a Barian?

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:25.390
That.. you can't mean that, right?

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:27.350
Shark...

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.850
Say something! Shark!

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:35.020
Then let me show you!

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.570
My true form!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.610
Bariarphose!

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.160
Bariarphose!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:57.000
We are the Seven Barian Emperors!

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:01.590
The True Galaxy-Eyes Master, Mizael!

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.680
Everything is within my grasp! Girag!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:09.930
My howling fists can break even God's bones! Alito!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.060
TA-DA! Me, Vector!

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:17.570
I can instantly freeze even the fires of the sun!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.570
Sword of Ice, Merag!

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:23.490
The Barian's White Shield, Durbe!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:29.740
And I am the one who leads the Seven Barian Emperors, I am Nasch!

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.750
Tha- that's... that's...!?

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.000
You are...

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.510
Nasch of the Barians?

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:42.380
Shark...

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:47.220
... so the legend of those ruins indeed was your true memory?

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:49.810
True memory?

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:54.390
In the vision that I saw, Shark as the King of a country.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:58.480
Probably his soul reincarnated in the Barian World,

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.150
becoming the current 'him'.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:05.700
That's just silly! Shark's 'soul' is the reincarnation of some old king!?

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:10.580
But... if that's true, then if he's a Barian, then why was he a human too?

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.200
I don't know.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:15.000
But what I do know...

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.330
... is that he is our enemy now.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.210
That's... why...?!

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.210
Just why!?

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.470
Why do we have to fight each other as friends!?

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.800
Yuma, this is what has been decided.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.270
This... is mine and your destiny!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.140
Destiny? Stop joking!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.690
I've been dueling with a lot of people by now.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.190
By dueling, we were able to clash our souls against one another,

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:43.820
and understand each other!

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.740
Shark, even if you became a Barian,

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.280
and say, you cut our bonds because of that,

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:55.790
I'll gonna revive them with a Duel again!

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.130
What the-?!

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.720
Rio!

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.560
I will absolutely avenge Rio!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.850
Vector! Wherever you run, I'll hunt you down!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.270
Here goes, Vector!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.740
These are... Shark's memories...

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:31.280
It's me who robbed it... Rio's... my friend's... everyone's lives!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:35.750
The true enemy they've been fighting...  is me!

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:46.130
<i>Isn't everyone having that fight... Anyone can come to understand each other!</i>

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:46.880
Is this... Yuma's memory?

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.340
<i>... If you don't want to learn that,</i>

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:53.350
I see... So you're carrying the weight of the world on your back too...?

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.010
<i>you can't achieve a true Rank-up!</i>

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.860
Yuma! Yuma!

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:04.940
Nasch!

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.610
Shark...! You...?

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:13.530
Yuma! Yuma!

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:15.790
Yuma too... If this goes on...

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.580
Retreat is also a kind of strategy, you know.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.120
So, steer clear for now.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.960
Wha- what's that?!

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:28.710
Everyone, let's retreat from here!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.050
Kotori! Tetsuo! Take Yuma!

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.800
Orbital! I'll leave Kaito with you!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.050
At your service!

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:38.350
What is this?
These guys are...

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.810
Yuma...

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.650
After them!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.530
Everyone safe?
 Yes!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.410
Kaito-<i>sama</i>...

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.200
We are not followed...

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.660
I guess, we escaped.
 You better<i> purr</i> careful.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.000
Found you!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.550
Yoooink!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.630
What?!

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:13.800
Who are you?!

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.470
I am... Anna!

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:22.640
Even if it kills me, I won't let you touch my Yuma with one finger!

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:26.110
Little girl, I won't forgive anyone who stands in my way.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:28.020
<i>You</i> won't forgive, you say?

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:29.690
Well, that's my-
That's my line!

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.070
Today is the banquet of justice again!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:38.910
Esper Robin, friend to those in trouble, has now arrived!

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:41.000
Esper Robin... and Anna...

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.080
Brother.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:47.000
It seems, that the Duelists who know about the world's crisis are showing up.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.050
Stop here.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.340
Huh?

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.760
No matter what... no matter what, I have to go.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:54.880
Let me off.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.350
You shall not pass.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.310
Prepare yourself.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:05.060
So, that smokescreen was your doing, right?

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:10.020
If you wish to go after my disciple, you'll have to get through us first.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.530
Pft. Interesting.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.570
As you wish, I'll crush you!

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.910
Damn... where did they go off to?

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.290
<i>Nice catch!</i>

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.870
Bastard, what are you up to?!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.080
I plan to block your way!

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:31.800
You there, you're the woman who dueled Tron in the Duel Carnival, right?

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:35.130
So you're stepping in to fight for your friends?

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.680
I won't let you pass on from here.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:41.850
Why did you come? To let your friend escape?

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.270
That's just like you.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.060
I am always me.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:49.400
And, Rio-<i>san</i>, it should be the same for you.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:53.530
I am sorry, but the one in front of you is me, Merag.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.690
There is no Rio anymore.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.950
Rio-<i>san</i> will always be Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:10.790
Nasch...

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.210
He anticipated us?

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:17.130
I will get off here.

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:21.050
Wait.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.520
I can't let you go.

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:27.940
That guy is the only man you called a friend.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.230
Can you fight such an opponent?

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:33.730
This is, why I have to go.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.940
As Yuma has passed out,

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:39.660
The only one who can move his heart... is me.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.910
I understand. Then, take this.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:50.250
This is the trump card you were making to fight the Barians, Brother.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:52.130
You finished it?

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:53.960
Yes, just now.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.760
I understand. With this, I'll gain a huge strength.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:13.060
IV, to buy them a bit of time, you came here to die?

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.270
Yuma has said...

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.530
that with a duel your and our bonds can be revived.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:20.530
That's what I will do.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:25.240
IV, me and you already live in different worlds.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:30.250
You wouldn't be able to understand, even if we Dueled ten thousand times.

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:33.330
I felt that way until recently, you know.

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:37.760
That once a friendship is broken, it can never be healed again.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:40.420
But, remember, Ryouga.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.680
Isn't it as with you and me?

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:45.720
If it's broken, isn't it okay to just link it up again?

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:47.180
Just you wait.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:51.810
I am sorry, but with my duel, some new wind will blow over to you,

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:55.230
I'll gonna send some real hot <i>Fanservice<i> to your heart!</i></i>

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.440
<i>Yuma, do you feel it?</i>

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:03.110
<i>The bonds you built up through duels, are now protecting you.</i>

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:07.700
<i>The Seven Emperors are powerful enemies,
but for now, I'll believe...</i>

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:11.000
... in the passionate feelings they embrace in their fight.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:17.380
Duel Disk... set!

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:37.360
Duel!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.950
Oy oy...

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.420
It seems things have gotten a bit interesting, Nasch.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.380
Let me take a good look at you.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.500
At your power right now.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:03.550
My turn! Draw!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.680
I summon Gimmick Puppet Humpty Dumpty!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.180
When this monster is summoned,

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:16.270
I can special summon one  Level 4 or lower Gimmick Puppet Monster from my hand!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:19.860
Appear, Gimmick Puppet Gear Changer!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:29.870
Next, I activate the Spell Card, Level Cross!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.200
This card lets me send one from my hand to the Graveyard

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:37.710
to double the Level of a Level 4 or lower monster.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:40.290
I chose Humpty Dumpty!

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:45.670
Then I activate the effect of Gimmick Puppet Gear Changer!

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:52.390
This guy's effect makes Gear Changer the same Level as Humpty Dumpty!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.180
Will it come... IV?

00:13:56.060 --> 00:14:00.270
I overlay my Level 8 Humpty Dumpty and Gear Changer!

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:07.450
With these two monsters I build the Overlay Network!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.200
Xyz Summon!

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:13.200
Appear! Numbers 15!

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:19.460
Gimmick Puppet Giant Killer!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.340
It came, the Numbers!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:27.420
Now, I activate the Equip Spell, Gimmick Shield!

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:32.390
I equip this card to one Gimmick Puppet Xyz Monster.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.810
Its Attack and Defense are switched with one another!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:39.850
Then for every Overlay Unit the equipped Xyz Monster has,

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.480
it inflicts 300 damage to my opponent!

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:45.690
Giant Killer has two Overlay Units.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:49.280
Therefore, you'll get hit by 600 damage!

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:54.450
How's that? Did you get an impression?

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.450
I'll end my turn with this!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.540
My turn, draw!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.710
I Summon Saber Shark!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.510
Then, I special summon Silent Angler!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:16.100
This monster, if I control a Water Attribute Monster,

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:18.730
can be special summoned! IV!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:21.480
Let me show you my true Ace!

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:28.110
I overlay the Level 4 Saber Shark and Silent Angler!

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:35.240
With these two monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:37.200
Xyz Summon!

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:42.080
Appear before us, Numbers 101!

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:46.040
Unappeased Soul, placed aboard the Ark!

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:49.670
Arise from the deepest abyss, unreachable by light!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.930
Silent Honor's Ark Knight!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:03.400
That's his Overhundred Numbers?!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:06.860
Silent Honor Ark Knight's effect activates!

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:08.940
By detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:12.700
it turns your Giant Killer into its Overlay Unit!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:13.910
What did you say?!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.780
Eternal Soul Asylum!

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:37.140
My Giant Killer is...

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:41.350
With Silent Honor's Ark Knight I attack directly!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.310
Million Phantom Flood!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.280
Do you understand? This is the power of the Barians.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:01.790
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.920
Appear, Numbers 103!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.750
Ragna Zero, the God-Slaying Ice Maiden!

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.090
Don't you get it?

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.140
I'm now a Barian in both body and spirit.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.390
Rio-<i>san</i>...

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:24.810
I get it. Your determination seems to be the real thing.

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:28.650
But... my determination too is the real thing!

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:31.070
I'm going to drag you back down to Earth!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.570
My turn! Draw!

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:35.450
It's there!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:40.490
I activate the Spell Card "Overlay Dark Reincarnation"!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:46.000
I randomly target one of the Overlay Units of my opponent's Xyz Monster and send it to the Graveyard.

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.250
If it's a Dark Attribute Monster,

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:51.040
that monster is special summoned to my field!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:57.880
But if it's not a Dark Attribute, my Life Points are halved!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.930
I've got fifty-fifty odds!

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:01.930
I choose the left one!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:07.890
Bingo.

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:11.860
The one I chose is the Dark Attribute Giant Killer!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:17.150
When a monster is special summoned with this effect,

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.860
I can draw 1 card!

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.200
Yes! It's here!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.910
To bring you back from Barian,

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:25.910
I shall go to that world, to greet you!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:30.960
I activate Rank-Up-Magic Argent Chaos Force!

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:35.550
<i>Humans</i> have their own new Rank-Up-Magic!?

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:40.090
My <i>human</i> brother made this card and entrusted it to me, the Trump of the mankind.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.680
This card allows me to Rank-Up my own Xyz Monster,

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:46.020
and Special Summon a Chaos Xyz!

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:50.060
I overlay my Rank 8 Giant Killer!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:55.190
I rebuild the Overlay Network with this Monster!

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.570
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:04.660
Come forth, Chaos Numbers 15!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:10.790
Oh, fruit of humanity's wisdom,

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:14.380
call forth the messenger to sever the strings of destiny!

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:23.180
Gimmick Puppet - Serial Killer!

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.150
Serial Killer's effect activates!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.770
By using one of this guy's Overlay Units,

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.280
your monster is destroyed,

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:42.200
and the ATK of that monster is inflicted to you as damage!

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:44.740
Extermination Slasher!

